      "message": "As per current framework not supporting sending USSD over IMS path so USSD dialed over IMS/CS will go over CS path using RIL interface.\nRef @ http://androidxref.com/8.0.0_r4/xref/frameworks/opt/telephony/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/imsphone/ImsPhoneMmiCode.java#764\nhttp://androidxref.com/8.0.0_r4/xref/frameworks/opt/telephony/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/imsphone/ImsPhoneMmiCode.java#976\n\nDue to this limitation we are trying to reuse the existing support of OEM_ERRORs in RIL interface.",
