    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f631ad5b_224b4442",
        "filename": "src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/imsphone/ImsPhoneMmiCode.java",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 1738,
      "author": {
        "id": 1228381
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-12-05T16:22:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In CS case as well we will not receive call forwarding number as part of SSData.\nPlease refer @ http://androidxref.com/8.0.0_r4/xref/frameworks/opt/telephony/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/gsm/GsmMmiCode.java#315",
      "parentUuid": "73849144_0ff6a184",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1734,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 1738,
        "endChar": 23
      },
      "revId": "ed269ea3935f64a4f8d9b9f28a07f72218f9ed5a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fed0dae9_c27be02d",
        "filename": "src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/imsphone/ImsPhoneMmiCode.java",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 1738,
      "author": {
        "id": 1121198
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-12-05T20:24:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I trust that the behavior matches GsmMmiCode, but unfortunately we don\u0027t have an expert on that code since it was upstreamed without very much review. For that exact reason I just want to make sure I\u0027m understanding this code before we merge it in.\n\nWhat does it mean to set call-forwarding without knowing the number to forward to? In both cases, why are we not getting the number with SSData and when do we get the number?",
      "parentUuid": "f631ad5b_224b4442",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1734,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 1738,
        "endChar": 23
      },
      "revId": "ed269ea3935f64a4f8d9b9f28a07f72218f9ed5a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3038e668_5819090a",
        "filename": "src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/imsphone/ImsPhoneMmiCode.java",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 1738,
      "author": {
        "id": 1228381
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-12-06T13:42:32Z",
      "side": 1,
